  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Soft corals and sea pens are the main coral groups in the Eastern Canadian Arctic, but little is known about their functional roles. In this study, samples of cold-water corals (soft corals and sea pens) were collected and subsampled as part of a project focused on better understanding the trophic ecology of cold-water soft corals in the region."
